      "writtenOn": "2026-02-09T15:42:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it\u0027s ET171.\n\n```suggestion\nconfig PLATFORM_EC_FINGERPRINT_ASCP_ET171\n\tbool \"Enable fingerprint ASCP ET171\"\n\thelp\n\t  Enables support for FP ASCP ET171.\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 23,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 26,
        "endChar": 37
      },
      "revId": "dbf7d25cb9e8034e7aec6a270770f36157aaf1a3",
